{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1754588865\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1754588865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1754588865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal world with a drunken alpaca! Solve puzzles, fish out the most unusual items from rivers, fight watermelon thugs, and uncover all the secrets of this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/38a6fb986b9b30d2fdef0aa55b47c4a6.poster.avif?t=1754588865\" width=628 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/38a6fb986b9b30d2fdef0aa55b47c4a6.webm?t=1754588865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/38a6fb986b9b30d2fdef0aa55b47c4a6.mp4?t=1754588865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink. Drink everything you find. There's no prohibition in this game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 crazy quests. Some may seem very strange; you never know what to expect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all 30 funny hats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 